    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BENEATH JERUSALEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/fac3a1b868f029347cb65e8cca320146.poster.avif?t=1752259540\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/fac3a1b868f029347cb65e8cca320146.webm?t=1752259540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/fac3a1b868f029347cb65e8cca320146.mp4?t=1752259540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1187 AD, Jerusalem. Saladin\u2019s army looms as you, driven by greed, delve into cursed tunnels for gold\u2014but darkness hides danger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JERUSALEM\u2019S GREEDY HAVEN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/9174ff92c283cbfa111575f33fe4074f.poster.avif?t=1752259540\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/9174ff92c283cbfa111575f33fe4074f.webm?t=1752259540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/9174ff92c283cbfa111575f33fe4074f.mp4?t=1752259540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Jerusalem, locals feign kindness, offering to bargain for gear or accept charity to lift your spirit\u2014but their greed exploits your gold hunger, hiking prices or banning you, leaving you desperate for more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RINGING BELLS, DEMONIC THREAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/d23ff3983bc17973579119bbab8ee20b.poster.avif?t=1752259540\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/d23ff3983bc17973579119bbab8ee20b.webm?t=1752259540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/d23ff3983bc17973579119bbab8ee20b.mp4?t=1752259540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Bells toll, unleashing the ancient Jerusalem demons\u2019 plague\u2014light your torch or lose faith to greed\u2019s whispers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DUNGEONPEDIA\u2019S SECRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/5fc1e1cada13e3f2e91560d0d8a219b3.poster.avif?t=1752259540\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/5fc1e1cada13e3f2e91560d0d8a219b3.webm?t=1752259540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/5fc1e1cada13e3f2e91560d0d8a219b3.mp4?t=1752259540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into history\u2019s empires\u2014uncover geography, figures like Herodotus, and artifacts in timeless ancient learning at your leisure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JERUSALEM\u2019S DESPERATE LOANS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/d3d7dacbcfca0c80862947d0121b907b.poster.avif?t=1752259540\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/d3d7dacbcfca0c80862947d0121b907b.webm?t=1752259540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/d3d7dacbcfca0c80862947d0121b907b.mp4?t=1752259540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When bargaining fails or prices soar, the usurer\u2019s loans trap you in debt\u2014but escape Saladin\u2019s siege or join the damned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BENEATH JERUSALEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/fac3a1b868f029347cb65e8cca320146.poster.avif?t=1752259540\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/fac3a1b868f029347cb65e8cca320146.webm?t=1752259540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/fac3a1b868f029347cb65e8cca320146.mp4?t=1752259540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1187 AD, Jerusalem. Saladin\u2019s army looms as you, driven by greed, delve into cursed tunnels for gold\u2014but darkness hides danger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JERUSALEM\u2019S GREEDY HAVEN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/9174ff92c283cbfa111575f33fe4074f.poster.avif?t=1752259540\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/9174ff92c283cbfa111575f33fe4074f.webm?t=1752259540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/9174ff92c283cbfa111575f33fe4074f.mp4?t=1752259540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Jerusalem, locals feign kindness, offering to bargain for gear or accept charity to lift your spirit\u2014but their greed exploits your gold hunger, hiking prices or banning you, leaving you desperate for more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RINGING BELLS, DEMONIC THREAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img